            group.quad (0x7C9*8)++7.
                bitfld.quad 0x00 0.--2. "MDCAUSE,Load access fault detail" ",PMP permission violation bus error,Bus error caused by core memory read,Bus error caused by NICE write back,,,,ECC error"
